ParentVault_claimShares
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the epoch is not claimable
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotClaimable
├── when the user has no deposit for the epoch
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoDeposit
└── when the claim is valid
    ├── it should mint the correct number of shares to the depositor
    ├── it should zero remaining counters for a single claimant
    ├── it should delete the depositor's deposit mapping entry
    ├── it should return the correct share mint amount
    ├── it should emit DepositClaimed
    ├── it should distribute rounding remainder to the pool-exhausting claimant
    ├── when the epoch is withdraw-only
    │   └── it should leave deposit-side remaining counters at zero
    └── when claims span sequential epochs
        └── it should keep remaining counters isolated by epoch nonce
